          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Although amounts of raisins and grapes reported to cause toxicosis lie in the range 2.8–9.6 g/kg and 11–31 g/kg, respectively, a minimum toxic dose has not been established. Additionally, not all exposures of dogs",
