              "subheading": "toVitis viniferahave resulted in clinical"
            },
            {
              "type": "subheading",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "other varieties ofVitis viniferahas also been",
              "pdf_page": 659,
              "printed_page": 577,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "associated with renal injury in dogs, but",
              "pdf_page": 659,
